  "description": "OpenAI-compatible hosted inference server over CircleAI.Hosting.InferenceBridge. Endpoints: /v1/chat/completions (SSE streaming), /v1/embeddings, /v1/companion/*, /v1/diagnostics, /v1/healthz, /v1/readyz. JWT and API-key auth out of the box. Ships Dockerfile, systemd unit, and a Windows-service install script. 1.3.4 picks up CircleAI.Inference 1.3.4 — adds osx-x64 + android-arm64. Server runs natively on 4 server platforms (win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, osx-x64) and the SDK is consumable on android-arm64 from MAUI.",
